    "body": "## Motivation\n\nWhen connecting to an HTTPS server signed by a custom CA, `RuntimeEndpoint(..., verify=\"/path/to/ca.pem\")` can initialize and make non-streaming requests, but streaming generation fails with `CERTIFICATE_VERIFY_FAILED`. The streaming branch of `http_request` omits `verify` when calling `requests.post`, so the supplied CA bundle is ignored.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- Forward `verify` to `requests.post` for streaming requests.\n- Add a CPU regression covering custom CA selection, certificate verification with the default `verify=None`, and streamed response consumption. It uses the real requests TLS configuration and mocks urllib3's network I/O boundary.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Regression: fails before the fix and passes afterward (1 test with custom/default CA subcases).\n- Separate local HTTPS reproduction: 2 tests passed, covering custom-CA streaming/non-streaming requests and rejection of an untrusted certificate with default settings.\n- Local environment: Python 3.12 on macOS arm64. Both the registered regression and the separate HTTPS reproduction ran directly with normal repository imports.\n- `pre-commit run --all-files --hook-stage pre-commit`: all applicable hooks passed, including all four Rust formatting/Clippy hooks.\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\n\nRegistered regression command:\n\n```bash\npython test/registered/unit/utils/test_http_request.py -v\n```\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nN/A — client-side TLS configuration only; model computation is unaffected.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nN/A — client-side TLS configuration only; inference computation and scheduling are unaffected.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format code with pre-commit: full-repository checks passed.\n- [x] Add focused unit tests, including a failure-before-fix check.\n- [x] Documentation reviewed: no update needed for restoring the existing `verify` option.\n- [x] Accuracy and speed benchmark applicability reviewed: N/A; see above.\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style guidance.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #39224759989](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39224759989)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39224759986](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39224759986)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #39224760000](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39224760000)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
